 "remarks": "Welcome Investors, First-Time Homebuyers & Owner-Occupants! Don't miss this incredible opportunity to own a well-maintained 2-family home in the heart of Stamford. Whether you're looking to build wealth through real estate, offset your mortgage with rental income, or expand your investment portfolio, this property offers exceptional versatility and immediate cash flow.  Unit 2 is currently rented month-to-month for $2,500/month, providing instant income with the flexibility to continue leasing or occupy in the future. Live in one unit while the rental income helps your mortgage, or rent both units to maximize your return.  Ideally located just minutes from Downtown Stamford, Metro-North, shopping, restaurants, parks, healthcare, major commuter routes, and numerous local amenities, this property offers outstanding convenience for both homeowners and tenants. Its desirable location continues to attract strong rental demand, making it an excellent long-term investment.  Whether you're a seasoned investor, first-time home owners, or someone looking for a smart \"house hack,\" 93 George Street delivers the perfect combination of flexibility, income potential, and future appreciation. Opportunities like this are hard to find. Own a cash-flowing multi-family property in one of Fairfield County's most desirable cities-schedule your private showing today! Being sold \"AS IS\". Will need at least 24 hours notice for showing.",
